### List Venues
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues

### Create Venue
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grand Tech Convention Center",
  "address": "450 Silicon Avenue",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "capacity": 1200,
  "rooms": [
    { "name": "Main Hall A", "capacity": 600, "floor": "1st Floor" },
    { "name": "Workshop Room B", "capacity": 150, "floor": "2nd Floor" }
  ],
  "facilities": ["High-speed Wi-Fi", "A/V Recording", "Live Streaming"]
}
